		<font size=-1 color=#555555>2002/12/7(土)11:36 - このまち - Hajime Chitose! (<font color=#0000ff>男</font>)  </font></table><blockquote>
Today, I'm gonna talk about the new druid skill DS, Wrath of the wind. Actually this DS's damage is a kind of crazy. As you know that Miss.Seshiry loves this spell, this is a kind of rune buff.<br><br>The difference with other rune buff is that this DS can subtruct only 1 point damage. But if you can keep this rune as possible as you can, you could be a tank who deal every 355 damage per mob's hit. That is wonderful damage, I guess. So you need to keep this DS rune of 1 point. For keeping this rune, we can use other types of rune.<br><br>But this DS can only stack with enchanter rune, especially Bedlam types of rune. We can't stack with rune V or so. But if you can use the bedlam types of rune, you can be a 355 damage dealer till your Rune will be gone.<br><br>According to Miss.Seshiry, this DS can stack with enchanter's self-rune. I'm not sure how much damage does her self-rune can absorbe, but it might be useful for her anyway. Frankly to speak, I guess this spell might be useful for enchanter, not druid...oh, god!<br><br><br>PS. By the way, I like the song of Hajime Chitose :P</blockquote><p>
